# Web UI

Build web interface with shadcn/ui and the Tailwind setup shadcn expects. Do not add Material UI, Chakra, Mantine, or a second headless kit.

```tsx
// Prefer a shadcn component
import { Button } from "@/components/ui/button";

<Button type="submit">Save duty</Button>
```

Compose screens from shadcn primitives. Pull in a new shadcn component when the screen needs it, instead of hand-rolling a parallel widget.

This rule is web only. It does not choose the iOS or Android toolkit.
